id: other-genes
name: Other Genes
order: 14
category: body
importance: secondary
# [Any - you decide]: the Saving Throw its Racial Saving Throw Bonus goes to, chosen as it is gained.
choose: savingThrow
description: >
  The blood of one of the many wild and wonderful alien races of the galaxy empowers you.
text: >
  Other Genes [Any – you decide] (Body): The blood of one of the many wild and wonderful alien races of the galaxy empowers you.
  (1)-[Passive]: Select a Race created through Custom Species. Gain access to a Custom Species Racial Trait possessed by that Race (you do not gain any Twinned effects). You cannot trade this Racial Trait out for a Factor Trait.
  (2)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Gain 1 Adaptation Point.
---

[passive]
# The Saving Throw named after its name - its Racial Saving Throw Bonus.
allow save.racial.$choice;
# (1) Custom Species is not in this system: the Race and its Racial Trait are the table's - the Trait, written, added by hand from the
# Traits tab as any Racial Trait is; its Twinned effects not had, and that it cannot be traded for a Factor Trait, the table's.

# (2) The Power Up used. Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/power, 1/round, effect 2]
adaptation.stacks += 1;
